sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Cashier
    participant FE as React (shiftReport / refund slices)
    participant SC as ShiftReportController
    participant RC as RefundController
    participant SS as ShiftReportService
    participant RS as RefundService
    C->>FE: start shift
    FE->>SC: POST /api/shift-reports/start?branchId
    SC->>SS: startShift
    SS-->>FE: ShiftReport (currentShift)
    C->>FE: refund an order
    FE->>RC: POST /api/refunds
    RC->>RS: createRefund
    RS->>RS: link order, cashier, branch, current shift
    RS-->>FE: RefundDTO
    FE->>SC: GET /api/shift-reports/current
    SC-->>FE: live totals
    C->>FE: end shift
    FE->>SC: PATCH /api/shift-reports/end
    SC->>SS: endShift
    SS->>SS: totals: sales, refunds, net, orders, payment summary
    SS-->>FE: final ShiftReport
